abstract: >-
  A native macOS benchmark and independent Python evidence core. The artifact
  contains the registered VoidToken v3 synthetic trajectory benchmark and a
  prospectively frozen VoidToken v5 quality evaluation with an
  integrity-protected, runner-recorded complete-container measurement for
  Qwen2.5-0.5B prefill KV caches.
keywords:
  - state trajectory compression
  - KV-cache compression
  - language-model inference
  - prospective evaluation
  - reproducible benchmark
